# G1 piston verified results.
# The rendered rollouts (.mp4) are committed via Git LFS -- see .gitattributes -- so
# anyone with repo access can view them on GitHub. Their per-rollout sidecar JSONs are
# small and tracked normally: they carry the checkpoint, the frozen condition hash and
# the state trajectory that each video's label is verified against.
#
# Only the Isaac Sim stdout logs are excluded: 5-14 MB each, pure boot noise, and
# regenerated by tools/g1_piston/run_render_queue.sh.
verified_results/**/*.log
